desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "IDe Settings Executable PATh Generic"
	title_zh: "检测到IDe Settings Executable PATh Generic",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-config-ide-settings-executable-path-generic"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Executable path override detected in VS Code settings pointing to a project-relative path. A malicious repository can override interpreter or tool paths in workspace settings to execute arbitrary code when the project is opened. Use absolute system paths instead of relative paths for executable settings, and review .vscode/settings.json in untrusted repos.

### 风险类型
安全配置不当（security-misconfiguration）

### 影响
安全相关配置缺失或过于宽松，可能暴露敏感功能或降低整体防护能力。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-94: Improper Control of Generation of Code
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则收紧配置，显式启用安全选项，并定期审计配置项。

推荐修复：
Use absolute system paths instead of relative paths for executable settings, and review .vscode/settings.json in untrusted repos.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos/settings.json": <<<POS
"KO8p*terminal.integrated.shell.Ka6aaaar":	 "./

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"[^"]*(?:executablePath|ExecutablePath|defaultInterpreterPath|pythonPath|terminal\.integrated\.shell\.\w+)"\s*:\s*"\.\.?\//) as $p0
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"[^"]*(?:executablePath|ExecutablePath|defaultInterpreterPath|pythonPath|terminal\.integrated\.shell\.\w+)"\s*:\s*"\.\.?\//) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "IDe Settings Executable PATh Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到IDe Settings Executable PATh Generic",
	message: "IDe Settings Executable PATh Generic",
}
